          receber os seus clientes no centro de Valongo.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://wa.me/351919786224?text=Ol%C3%A1!+Tenho+interesse+no+Aluguer+de+Mesa+ou+Cadeira+na+Klassy."
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-[var(--cor-secundaria)] hover:bg-[var(--cor-secundaria-hover)] text-[#1a1217] text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider transition-all duration-300 shadow-md hover:-translate-y-0.5"
        >
          <span>Consultar Condições de Aluguer</span>
          <span>→</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
